From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anxelok <anxelok@localhost>
Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 22:58:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Control player chunk delivery

Add queue diagnostics and backpressure for chunk loading and sending. Bound initial bursts and deduplicate per-tick scheduling so delayed clients do not grow unbounded work.

